<BaseLayout title="Privacy notice — draft" description="Draft privacy information for CashForPhilly inquiries; pending owner and legal review before production." noindex>
  <section><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Draft — not legally approved</p><h1>Privacy notice (draft)</h1><p class="notice">Operated by Anthony Villar, an individual doing business as CashForPhilly, 1100 E Hector St, Suite 419, Conshohocken, PA. Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@cashforphilly.com">contact@cashforphilly.com</a>. Pending final owner/legal approval.</p><h2>Information and purpose</h2><p>Inquiry forms collect your name, contact method, property location and type when applicable, message, optional marketing consent and first-party campaign attribution. This information is used to respond to your inquiry. A fraud-prevention challenge is processed by Cloudflare Turnstile.</p><h2>Processing and access</h2><p>Submissions are stored in a dedicated Cloudflare D1 database accessible to authorized operators. Cloudflare Pages processes the request and Turnstile verifies the challenge. Inquiry data is not automatically enrolled in Constant Contact. If you separately choose a verified Constant Contact signup, that provider processes subscription details under its own terms.</p><h2>Retention and your choices</h2><p>Inquiry records are kept for up to four years and then deleted, unless a longer period is required by law or a transaction. If your inquiry concerns a specific property, relevant details may be shared with prospective buyers or transaction partners, including through New Western's Investor Marketplace, only as needed to carry out that conversation. You may request access, correction or deletion by emailing contact@cashforphilly.com; we will respond within a reasonable time, subject to legal record-keeping duties. Optional marketing consent is unchecked by default; no SMS marketing is enabled.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
